**PHP Code:**

```php
<?php
// Database configuration
$host = 'localhost';
$dbname = 'your_database_name';
$username = 'your_username';
$password = 'your_password';

try {
    // Create a PDO instance
    $pdo = new PDO("mysql:host=$host;dbname=$dbname", $username, $password);
    $pdo->setAttribute(PDO::ATTR_ERRMODE, PDO::ERRMODE_EXCEPTION);

    // Define your query
    $sql = "SELECT c.id AS category_id, c.name AS category_name,
                   sc.id AS subcategory_id, sc.name AS subcategory_name,
                   t.id AS topic_id, t.title AS topic_title
            FROM categories c
            LEFT JOIN subcategories sc ON c.id = sc.category_id
            LEFT JOIN topics t ON sc.id = t.subcategory_id
            ORDER BY c.id, sc.id, t.id";

    // Prepare and execute the statement
    $stmt = $pdo->prepare($sql);
    $stmt->execute();

    // Fetch all results
    $rows = $stmt->fetchAll(PDO::FETCH_ASSOC);

    // Process and display the data in a nested format
    $results = [];

    foreach ($rows as $row) {
        $categoryId = $row['category_id'];
        $categoryName = $row['category_name'];
        $subCategoryId = $row['subcategory_id'];
        $subCategoryName = $row['subcategory_name'];
        $topicId = $row['topic_id'];
        $topicTitle = $row['topic_title'];

        // Initialize category if not set
        if (!isset($results[$categoryId])) {
            $results[$categoryId] = [
                'name' => $categoryName,
                'subcategories' => []
            ];
        }

        // Initialize subcategory if not set
        if ($subCategoryId !== null && !isset($results[$categoryId]['subcategories'][$subCategoryId])) {
            $results[$categoryId]['subcategories'][$subCategoryId] = [
                'name' => $subCategoryName,
                'topics' => []
            ];
        }

        // Add topic to subcategory
        if ($topicId !== null) {
            $results[$categoryId]['subcategories'][$subCategoryId]['topics'][] = [
                'id' => $topicId,
                'title' => $topicTitle
            ];
        }
    }

    // Output the data
    foreach ($results as $category) {
        echo "Category: " . $category['name'] . "\n";
        foreach ($category['subcategories'] as $subCat) {
            echo "  Subcategory: " . $subCat['name'] . "\n";
            foreach ($subCat['topics'] as $topic) {
                echo "    Topic: " . $topic['title'] . "\n";
            }
        }
        echo "\n";
    }

} catch (PDOException $e) {
    echo "Error: " . $e->getMessage();
}
?>
```

**Notes:**
- Replace `'your_database_name'`, `'your_username'`, `'your_password'` with your actual database credentials.
- Adjust table andcolumn names if your schema differs.
- The PHP code processes the flat query results to create a nested array for better readability, then displays it hierarchically.

